{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月7日，英國首相安迪·伯納姆（Andy Burnham）正準備利用11月舉行的兩場歐洲峯會，推動英國與歐盟建立更緊密的經濟關係，以減少脱歐後貿易壁壘對英國經濟增長的影響。伯納姆將於11月12日出席在都柏林舉行的歐洲政治共同體會議，並於11月20日前往布魯塞爾參加英歐峯會。英國政府希望藉此推動此前進展緩慢的雙邊談判。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585438.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.664631+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:39:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"994f036f7df9a85dc76ca41511835539e6eefd1659b59cc0389d19baf4a2fc9c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}